WEBVTT

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.280
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.420
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.210
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.890
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.130
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:45.890
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, 
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.740
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.130
It's simple.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:33.500
Episode 10
Secrets to Be Hidden

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.500
I'll tell you right now.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:35.000
Watch very carefully.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:38.820
Witness what happens to anyone

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:43.010
who stands against me or
mocks me from now on.

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:47.580
<i>Just wait, Shin.</i>

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:51.100
<i>Next time... it's your turn.</i>

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:01.490
Take positions.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.120
Get ready...

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:27.590
Go for it! Go for it!

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:29.300
Shiori, go for it!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.180
Go for it! It's the final sprint!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.680
Yeah!

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.420
Great job, Hibiki!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.800
You're amazing! That was great!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.900
We won!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.260
Witness what happens to anyone

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:22.150
who stands against me 
or mocks me from now on.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.240
Who am I?

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.490
That's not me...

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.010
That can't be me!

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.500
Hibiki?

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.740
What are you doing?

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.310
Let's go back to the classroom.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.380
Shiori...

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.410
You want to become a coward?

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:05.490
Maybe I should teach you...

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:09.490
what the right path is.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.310
No... I don't want to be like you!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.240
Stay away!

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.860
Stop playing dumb.

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:20.900
This is what you really are!

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.010
Shiori!

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.970
M... Moku?

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:36.250
Oh, Hibiki-kun...

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.740
You're awake?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:39.190
You startled me.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.890
Maybe you should sleep a while longer.

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:43.800
I'm better now.

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.050
B-Big Bro Hibiki...

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:49.170
What? What do you want?

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.860
Um... Big Bro Hibiki...

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:55.950
We've been extremely rude to you in the past.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.510
But please, be forgiving of us.

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:01.360
We'll do whatever you say from now on!

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.360
We're sorry, Big Bro!

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:08.840
Hey, Sei.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.870
What? Why should I apologize when 
I didn't do anything wrong?

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:18.020
Hibiki, I thought you were all 
talk, but I had you wrong.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:21.420
I won't apologize, but I'll 
follow you from now on.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.240
You all mocked me a great deal before.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.350
This is quite the sudden change of heart.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:29.840
W-Well...

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:33.890
Why do you want me to accept you now?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.960
Hey, Hibiki!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.400
What do you mean, accept us?

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:39.750
Don't act so high and mighty!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:40.800
Oh?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.500
What are you saying?

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:44.810
Would you be opposing me, by chance?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.190
Out of my way.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.600
<i>There's something strange going on.</i>

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:56.370
<i>In the past, they were always 
trying to earn Shin's good favor.</i>

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.010
<i>I just took out Yoh.</i>

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:02.690
<i>If they're asking me for help rather 
than beating me while I was down...</i>

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.940
<i>Have they stopped being afraid of Shin?</i>

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.500
<i>No one's talking about Shin.</i>

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:12.520
<i>By contrast, Yoh came out 
into the open abruptly.</i>

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.270
Is that Hibiki?

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.990
You're the loser that Yoh-san beat up.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:17.800
H-Hibiki!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.390
Y-You hit Yoh-senpai?

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:22.250
If you help him now, 
everything goes back to normal!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.460
Do you wanna die?!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.640
Vice Head Instructor Ryo 
is on Yoh-senpai's side.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.920
Doing what Yoh-senpai 
says is the safest route.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.640
<i>Was Shin intentionally 
putting Yoh front and center</i>

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.840
<i>so he could manipulate 
things behind the scenes?</i>

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:37.690
<i>But even though it's well 
known that I beat Yoh,</i>

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.430
<i>the whole school's gone quiet again.</i>

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.850
<i>More surprising, Ryo hasn't 
tried anything on me, either.</i>

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:47.120
If you join me, 
I'll make sure you won't regret it.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:49.840
I intended to leave class six to you.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:53.200
But Yoh is smart, so he came to me.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.070
If you won't be my dog, you'll be my enemy.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.310
Choose which one you prefer.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:06.820
<i>Shin... what the hell is he thinking?</i>

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.050
Hey, everyone.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:12.050
Have you heard anything about Shin lately?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.170
About Shin?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:16.080
No, nothing lately...

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.510
Haven't seen him, and he hasn't 
caused any trouble, either.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:19.580
I see.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.660
If he does anything, from now on, 
let me know immediately.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.790
R-Right. Got it...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.910
If you want to rely on me from now on,

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:29.700
then as your roommate,

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:32.650
I'll take you all as family.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.530
R-Really?

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.850
And if any of you bully Moku,

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:41.490
you'll be made to regret it.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.160
G-Got it!

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.500
Uh... Um...

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.210
<i>Listen, Shin.</i>

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.970
<i>We haven't settled things yet.</i>

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:55.000
<i>No matter where you're hiding, 
I'll drag you into the open.</i>

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.570
Big Bro, we're almost there.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.650
The cargo will arrive in two days.

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.210
I hear the students are acting up,

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.020
and the instructors are dragging their feet.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.880
I'll nip things in the bud.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.010
<i>Keep an eye out for Shin.</i>

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:13.130
You know your little brother well.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.920
<i>That oddball.</i>

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.370
<i>I never know what he's thinking...</i>

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:22.140
<i>He even asked Father to let 
him enter that rubbish school.</i>

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.480
Regardless, we are brothers.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:28.820
<i>You really think I'd hurt my brother?</i>

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.400
He doesn't have much longer.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.510
Bring him home while you're at it, too.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.450
If, as his brother,

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:38.510
I didn't look after him to the end,

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.960
<i>Father would be sad.</i>

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.870
Leave it to me.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:47.020
I'm about to lose signal, 
so we can talk later.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:55.190
What are you doing?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:58.990
Will you lend me this cell phone?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:03.810
You know Vice Head Instructor Ryo 
is on class six's side, right?

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:07.110
You want to earn his wrath 
by stealing my cell phone?

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.010
I see how it is...

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:12.420
She was just trying to borrow 
it for a little while.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.500
Shall I send you to the hospital?

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:17.510
You can join Yoh there.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.020
H-Hey, you two...

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:22.140
My little sister has a very short temper.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.350
You'd be better off just giving in.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.210
I just wanna borrow it a little while!

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.270
I'll give it back after our fun is over!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.520
What the hell kind of 
head instructor are you?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.000
You can't even properly manage the students.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.740
Yet you're going to defy your superior?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:00.870
Hey, Hyo. What are you doing?

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:03.690
Students fighting is common enough.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.260
It's nothing to beat the 
head instructor over.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:10.540
I've warned the head instructor 
about Shin many times.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:15.390
Because of him, the school has gone to pot.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.740
You've ignored everything I've told you!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.570
<i>That fool Shian.</i>

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:35.000
<i>Did he really think he was safe 
as long as Jean was on his side?</i>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.480
A cop would be fired over far less.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.160
Worthless fool...

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.220
Hyo, that's enough.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.060
You're the one who twisted our 
arms to admit Shin, aren't you?

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.670
We've looked after him just like you wanted.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:51.920
How dare you find fault with us after that?!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:55.520
Headmistress, do you have a problem 
with how Big Bro does things?

00:11:56.260 --> 00:12:00.400
Oh, did you finally remember 
that I'm the headmistress?

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.020
Show some respect.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:02.800
Listen.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.990
Don't bring any more of your 
nonsense into this school.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:09.000
You're the one in trouble if 
any problems occur, aren't you?

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.480
Headmistress Jean.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:20.550
You really are something.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.430
I'll leave supervision of 
the instructors to you.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.230
Head Instructor Shian.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:29.560
You should rest up and see to your injuries.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.430
I'll look after the students 
while you're gone.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.500
No objections to that, right?

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.330
Well, then...

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.310
Instructor Ryo. Let's go.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:41.790
Yes, sir.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:49.060
Head Instructor Shian's gotten a 
little too big for his breeches.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.930
Big Bro, that was amazing.

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:58.080
Head Instructor Shian needed 
to be brought into line.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.170
He's made a lot of trouble for me, too.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.500
Both Wudo and Yoh were laid out by 
Hibiki, a new student in Shian's class.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.310
We should put an end to Hibiki, too.

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:11.020
Instructor Ryo. I need to ask you a question.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.020
Where's the cell phone?

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.980
It requires a password.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:20.290
And it's been a few days, 
so it's probably out of power...

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.220
I d-don't think it'll be a serious problem.

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:25.610
Listen, Ryo. I have no love for Shian,

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.990
but I do know one thing.

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:31.490
He'd never beat a student to death.

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:34.990
Are you going to shift the 
blame on Wudo, nonetheless?

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:38.500
And where, exactly, is Shin?

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.590
L-Look... I don't know anything about Shin.

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.010
I haven't seen him since then.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:48.010
His lackey, Ban, disappeared, too.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.430
Disappeared?

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.010
Why don't you tell me exactly 
what's been going on here?

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.180
Don't leave a single thing out.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.610
Y-Yes, sir.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.550
No reception?

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:05.530
You mean you can only get 
certain designated pages?

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.710
No question.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:10.490
The phones circulated around the 
school are basically gaming systems.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:15.000
Unable to send message

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.720
They can't call or send email.

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:14.990
Can't connect to outside networks, either.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:18.210
If they could, people might know a lot 
more about what goes on at the school!

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:21.060
You're talkative when it comes 
to the Internet, at least.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.030
That explains why you're here.

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.260
Hey!

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:27.010
This phone is connected 
to the school's network.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.510
And since access authority is limited,

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.530
it's all view-only.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:35.210
You promised you'd let me 
call my little brother.

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:38.420
I told you, this place 
blocks cell phone signal.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:41.140
You'd never be able to 
use a cell phone to talk.

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:44.020
That said, I <i>am</i> a genius...

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:47.660
I can break through any limitation 
put on any cell phone!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:52.440
Plus, I've set up my own 
network I coded myself.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:54.720
If we had my device that 
connects to that network,

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.850
we call and use 
the Internet as much as we want!

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.870
We've got the cell phone, 
now let's get my device!

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.200
Once I get that back, it's all in the bag!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.250
Shiori? What's wrong?

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:08.010
We're so close to our goal, 
but you don't look happy...

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:14.010
Have you heard anything about Shin lately?

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:17.060
He's kept a pretty low 
profile lately, I guess.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.960
Nothing unusual about that.

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:22.420
Manipulating others from the 
shadows is Shin's usual MO.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.360
<i>I think there's more to it than that.</i>

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.470
Do you know a girl named Jun?

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.510
Jun?

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:36.990
Isn't that the girl Wudo 
bullied on the field before?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.160
Yeah.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.880
She said she could call her boyfriend.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:44.500
I think there's more to 
her than meets the eye.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.080
If we can't beat Shin right now,

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.950
we should change our strategy 
and investigate Jun.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.060
Shiori.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:52.510
Can I ask a question?

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:56.100
How did an honor student 
like you end up here?

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.570
Your parents are dead.

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.100
Your little brother's in the hospital.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.540
Who got you sent here?

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.050
Good question!

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:05.780
I thought it was strange 
from the day you arrived.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.070
Hey, look at that girl.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.100
A new girl? What's her name?

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.610
Shiori, they say.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.300
Looks like the honor student type.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.110
Does she really have Internet addiction?

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.380
Our student of the month is Shiori!

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.100
I want you all to learn from her example.

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:24.500
Head Instructor, if I do everything I'm 
told, can I get out of here early?

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.420
I'll do what I can.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.510
I'll let the headmistress and 
your guardian know about it.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.210
Yes, sir.

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.010
Shiori.

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.510
You're an excellent student.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.000
Don't forget to put in hard work.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:38.720
Yes, sir!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:43.010
Shiori, I'm disappointed in you.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:47.850
Shiori, is this how you repay my generosity?

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:49.020
You little brat...

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:52.610
Who is it that's looked after 
you since your parents died?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.480
I even paid for your brother's treatment...

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:56.250
How dare you defy me...

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:00.140
I know... I'll give you a 
real taste of loneliness.

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:02.000
You'll never see your brother again!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.970
Here you are.

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:13.500
Oh! Darling, you came!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.160
You're looking feisty.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.500
Change of plans.

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.500
Come with me.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:19.900
I'm leaving.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.780
Good luck.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.100
Wow, she really did leave.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:41.000
<i>If they learn what happened, 
they'll definitely hate me.</i>

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:45.680
<i>I need to handle things on my own after all.</i>

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:55.410
I know, Big Bro.

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.270
Don't worry.

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:59.270
I have an idea.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:01.490
I'll find Shin, no matter what.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:05.020
He's still human. 
He can't just vanish into thin air.

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:11.300
Hyo, you'll avenge me, won't you?

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.620
I've been a good girl like you told me to,

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.030
but they still bullied me...

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:20.710
You're doing very well.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.040
I won't let you suffer any more.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.670
Hibiki...

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.610
Why are you searching for 
Shin all of a sudden?

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:29.040
I think something strange is going on.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.710
With Yoh out of the picture,

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.540
this is our chance to attack Shin.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:38.050
So... this is Shin's hideout?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.520
Is it really?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.020
Hey! Shin, are you here?

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.450
Come out right now!

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.900
Give back my precious device!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.530
<i>What the hell...</i>

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:53.400
What's with that forbidding expression?

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.520
Hey!

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:03.540
What the hell...

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:12.990
Well, isn't this a luxurious little suite?

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.930
Where's Shin?

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:18.170
No, priorities... I gotta find my device!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:29.300
<i>There's so much...</i>

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.000
<i>...chocolate.</i>

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:39.940
<i>This is...</i>

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:58.600
<i>You're kidding me.</i>

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:02.710
<i>Is he...</i>

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:12.520
<i>I'll try to get Jun to level with me.</i>

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:19.020
Were you looking for me?

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:20.600
That's great.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:22.530
It saves me the time of searching for you.

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:26.030
You...

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:31.350
Let's see if I can guess what 
you're going to ask about.

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:32.490
Let's see...

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:35.130
"Why are you the only one who 
can use a phone to call people?"

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.530
"How did you smuggle a phone in here?"

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:39.460
"What did you come here for?"

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.520
"Where did my roommates go?"

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:43.040
What are you getting at?

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:47.700
Your little brother, Shu...

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:50.850
I hear he's not doing well lately.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.520
Get away from me!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:55.190
I don't have time for games!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:57.810
I saw your record.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.440
Special circumstances, huh?

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.520
Your treatment period for Internet addiction

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.010
is infinite.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:04.690
Isn't that right?

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:08.030
No matter how hard you work, 
or how good you act,

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:13.480
you won't get out of here unless 
your guardian allows it.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.540
What a sad fate!

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:18.630
Oh, don't glare at me like that.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.540
I just want to help you.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.440
You want to hear your little 
brother's voice again, don't you?

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.550
<i>You...</i>

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.550
If you do everything I say,

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:31.010
I can get you out of here in two days' time.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.990
What do you think?

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:34.700
Shu...

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:52.010
<i>Damn you, Shin...</i>

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:55.080
<i>What the hell are you planning?</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:27.290
Mom!

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.930
I see you do have good points.

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:32.470
But don't think you'll 
see your brother again.

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:31.460
They'll cure his illness, won't they?

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:33.540
He'll get better, won't he?

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.510
Cry and beg me!

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:39.980
Episode 11
The Icy Wall of Despair

00:23:36.860 --> 00:23:38.400
You foolish woman!

00:23:38.400 --> 00:23:39.720
Hibiki...
